The plays (app/data/*.json)
  Built by tools/build_data.py from the Moby Shakespeare text as published at
  https://shakespeare.mit.edu/ (copy from https://github.com/TheMITTech/shakespeare/).
  The site states that its HTML versions of the plays are placed in the public domain.
  The JSON keeps the words as they are and adds structure (acts, scenes, speakers,
  line counts); speaker names were evened out as described in docs/DEVELOPING.md.

